# Magic Leap 2 Fleet — KAGAMI Device List
# One IP per line. Comments (#) and blank lines are ignored.
# Assign static DHCP leases on your router so IPs never change.
#
# Format:
#   <ip_address>   [optional comment]
#
# Group by venue/zone if helpful:

# ── Venue A ──────────────────────────────
192.168.1.101
192.168.1.102
192.168.1.103
# ... add all 200 devices here

# ── Venue B (if applicable) ──────────────
# 10.0.1.101
# 10.0.1.102
